[Mission.Objectives]
Eliminate the enemy
[Mission.Description]
Eliminate the enemy in the town of Thala.
[Mission.Success]
Enemy defences in Thala have been completely eliminated.
[Mission.Failed]
Mission failed.
[Submission_1.Objectives]
Conduct recon
[Submission_1.Description]
Conduct recon to find enemy positions. Correct the ground strikes of our assault air forces.
[Submission_1.Success]
Enemy artillery positions have been located. Precise coordinates have been transmitted to air forces.
[Submission_1.Failed]
Mission failed.
[Submission_2.Objectives]
Destroy the enemy tanks
[Submission_2.Description]
British tanks have been sighted. We are ordered to engage and destroy the enemy tanks.
[Submission_2.Success]
The enemy tank force has been eliminated.
[Submission_2.Failed]
Mission failed.
[StringTable.income]
We've been reinforced with more troops to continue the offensive.
[Submission_3.Objectives]
Eliminate enemy defences on the heights
[Submission_3.Description]
The enemy established defences on the heights beyond Thala. According to our intelligence, the British have enough anti-tank weaponry. Eliminate enemy defences on the heights.
[Submission_3.Success]
Enemy defences have been eliminated.
[Submission_3.Failed]
Mission failed.